    {"file":"15-postgresql-mvcc.svg","title":"两个事务读取同一行版本","subtitle":"MVCC 提供可见快照；版本条件拒绝过期写入","nodes":[{"id":"t1","x":45,"y":105,"title":"T1：读取 v8","detail":"修改笔记 · 写入 v9","tone":"teal"},{"id":"t2","x":45,"y":286,"title":"T2：读取 v8","detail":"稍后提交另一条笔记","tone":"amber"},{"id":"row","x":365,"y":198,"title":"案件行版本","detail":"数据库可见的最新状态","tone":"navy"},{"id":"result","x":680,"y":198,"title":"条件更新结果","detail":"T1 成功 · T2 影响 0 行","tone":"coral"}],"edges":[{"from":"t1","to":"row","label":"UPDATE v8 → v9"},{"from":"t2","to":"row","label":"WHERE Version = 8"},{"from":"row","to":"result","label":"检测冲突"}],"footer":"RiskCase 将并发冲突映射为 HTTP 412，提醒用户重新读取和确认"},
